      "description": "COMLS Financial Operations Administrator 1 - Health Science Campus College Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States COMLS Financial Operations Administrator 1 - Health Science Campus College Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States Kiosk mode UToledo Careers COMLS Financial Operations Administrator 1 501684 Health Science Campus College Toledo, OH Administration Finance Full-Time None Show More Show Less Staff - Full-Time Add to favorites View favorites Title: COMLS Financial Operations Administrator 1 Department Org: Physiology and Pharmacology - 107530 Employee Classification: J1 - Salaried Full Time HSC Bargaining Unit: Professional Staff Association Primary Location: HSC C Shift: 1 Posted Salary: Starting $68,077.43 Job Description: Reporting directly to the Chair of their assigned department(s), the Administrator will manage fiscal operations, compliance, and employee/faculty employment needs for their assigned area(s). Taking direction from and in collaboration with their chair, establishes department business and administrative mission and goals, and optimal environment that supports the department and College of Medicine’s academic and research program/activities and services. This role may work directly with faculty, staff, chairs, research professionals, and clinic administrators. This role is vital for overall operations for their assigned departments which can include clinic budget operations and research operations as well as the implementation of the department(s) strategic plan and assist with the development of business plans for new programs. Minimum Qualifications: Bachelor’s degree in business administration, Management or Accounting required. Master’s degree in business administration, Management or Accounting preferred. At least one to three (1-3) years of experience working in related administrative management position(s) is required. Conditions of Employment: To promote the highest levels of health and well-being, the University of Toledo 