    "https://careers.utoledo.edu/jobs/basic-outpatient-presvc-spec-health-science-campus-hospital-toledo-oh-ohio-united-states-63ce6807-fe2d-4978-935d-15d00f8bc6b4": {
      "title": "Basic Outpatient Presvc Spec",
      "description": "Basic Outpatient Presvc Spec - Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States Basic Outpatient Presvc Spec - Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States Kiosk mode UToledo Careers Basic Outpatient Presvc Spec 501469 Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH AFSCME Full-Time Healthcare Positions Hospital Administration Support Services Show More Show Less Staff - Full-Time Add to favorites View favorites Title: Basic Outpatient Presvc Spec Department Org: Registration - 108820 Employee Classification: B1 - Classif'd Full Time AFSCME HSC Bargaining Unit: AFSCME HSC Primary Location: HSC H Shift: 1 Start Time: 8:30AM End Time: 5:00PM Posted Salary: Float: Yes Rotate: Yes On Call: Yes Travel: Yes Weekend/Holiday: Yes Job Description: The Basic Outpatient Preservice Specialist performs all outpatient scheduling, pre-registration and insurance verification for non-invasive, routine care services. Performs complete and accurate patient appointment scheduling, account pre-registration and insurance verification functions either via electronic media collection or telephonic interview methods; works to provide patient information which maximizes reimbursement, achieves collection ratios, meets accounts receivable (AR) goals, and provides timely and through information to all other providers and users of patient data. Verifies insurance requirements, obtains and understands insurance benefits. Requests any non-covered patient collectibles such as coinsurance, deductibles, and copayments prior to service; Ensures that patients meet financial requirements; Provides general information to hospital users, patients and families; Communicates effectively to service delivery areas to maximize patient flow and customer service outcomes both internally and externally. Minimum Qualifications: - High School diploma or equivalent required - Previous customer service experience required - Working knowledge to operate a computer in a 