      "title": "Assistant Professor, Department of Surgery, Plastic Surgeon",
      "description": "Assistant Professor, Department of Surgery, Plastic Surgeon - Health Science Campus College Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States Assistant Professor, Department of Surgery, Plastic Surgeon - Health Science Campus College Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States Kiosk mode UToledo Careers Assistant Professor, Department of Surgery, Plastic Surgeon 494984 Health Science Campus College Toledo, OH Academic Faculty Full-Time Healthcare Positions None Show More Show Less Faculty - Regular Add to favorites View favorites Job Description: UToledo Health and the University of Toledo College of Medicine and Life Sciences invites applications for a Plastic Surgeon in the Department of Surgery. Candidates must have completed an accredited plastic surgery training program. Successful applicants should have experience in a full spectrum of Plastic and Reconstructive Surgery. The primary practice location is at the University of Toledo Medical Center, an academic level II Trauma center. Opportunity exists to build a cosmetic practice as well. As a faculty member, this position will be responsible for academic activities including teaching of medical students and residents; research; and related service duties. Minimum Qualifications: MD or DO Successful completion of Residency in Plastic Surgery Board Certified or Board Eligible by the American Board of Plastic Surgery Possess leadership skills, strong interpersonal skills, and exceptional clinic ability. Benefits: Retirement Benefits, including two pension plans UTP has a pension plan with employer contribution. UT Academic pension Eligibility for health, dental, vision, and life insurance coverage through the University of Toledo Paid time off, paid parental and maternity leave UT provides a Tuition Fee Waiver Program for Employees and Dependents Long Term and Short-Term Disability UTP opts out of FICA, reducing the employee's payroll taxes About Toledo, Ohio: The city of Toledo is located in NW Ohio near the western poi